{
    "title": "Chain Cube: 2048 3D merge game",
    "description": "Are you ready to challenge yourself? Chain Cube 2048 is an addictive merge puzzle game for those who like challenging brain teasers and logic puzzle merge games. Believe, it is much harder to reach 2048 cube than drop the number. \r\n\r\nA whole new take on the famous brain teaser number game 2048! Now in 3D with crazy fun physics! Cubes don't stay in place \u2014 they fall realistically and bounce off each other if you haven\u2019t managed to merge cube number blocks! \r\n\r\nDon't try to hide it, we know you can't get enough fun out of 2048 games! So don't be shy, do yourself a favor and download Chain Cube 2048 - simple but extremely addictive number merge game and number drop! You need to drop the number blocks to get the highest score and solve the 2248 puzzle bounce merge cube games, numbers game! \r\n\r\nCHAIN CUBE 2048 MERGE GAME FEATURES:\r\n\r\n\u2605 Easy to learn, hard to master number games, cube games and number puzzle\r\n\u2605 Drop the number to solve the 1024, 2248, 2048 cube puzzle\r\n\u2605 Match numbers and make new number cubes\r\n\u2605 No time limits in bounce merge games\r\n\u2605 Smooth & simple control cubes number drop\r\n\u2605 Fun 3D physics merge game 2248 puzzle\r\n\u2605 Merge cube & reach 2248 in 2048 games, 1024 games, number puzzle and numbers game\r\n\r\nTo test your brain by solving 2048 puzzle in number games, check out the 2248 puzzle gameplay which is quite simple: \r\n\r\n1. Aim precisely to shoot and drop the number block with the same color in cube puzzle\r\n2. Shoot and hit the number block with the same color and number drop\r\n3. Group blocks together to bounce merge cube and get a block with new number\r\n4. Keep playing without fail and reach 2248 in number puzzle! \r\n\r\nBut why stop there? Merge numbers, drop the number and beat your record 2048! There are no limits! You may also continue to drop the number in this 2248 puzzle game, cube games and try to reach a 32M cube in the bounce merge game! Collect not just one 32M cube, but as many as you can!\r\n\r\nGet ready for awesome graphics, a user-friendly interface, intuitive game controls and fun 3D physics in 1024, numbers game, cube games and 2048, 2248 puzzle! Merge cube, merge numbers and earn points to unlock cool skins for your chain cube! Have lots of fun playing with eastern eggs, animal cubers, and even impostors! \r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Merge cube and show everyone who is the king of 2048 games, merge number games, numbers game and 2248 puzzle! Download and play the merge numbers 2048 puzzle game right now!\r\n\r\n========================\r\n<strong>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</strong> \r\n========================\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
